sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Dashboard / API caller
    participant F as FastAPI router
    participant P as Pydantic request schema
    participant D as Auth + RBAC dependencies
    participant S as Domain service
    participant R as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    A->>F: JSON body + Bearer access token
    F->>P: Parse types, required fields and formats
    alt Shape or field rule invalid
        P-->>A: 422 validation error and no service call
    else Schema valid
        F->>D: Authenticate token and require role
        alt Unauthenticated or forbidden role
            D-->>A: 401 or 403 and no persistence
        else Authorised
            F->>S: Validated model + current user
            S->>S: Enforce lifecycle, ownership and uniqueness rules
            alt Domain rule violated
                S-->>A: 400 / 403 / 404 / 409 structured error
            else Domain rule valid
                S->>R: Create or update entity
                R->>DB: Parameterised SQLAlchemy transaction
                DB-->>R: Persisted row
                R-->>S: Domain model
                S-->>F: Safe response model
                F-->>A: 200 / 201 response envelope
            end
        end
    end
